  "details": "Why making such changes to the particle systems because of people abusing it? I would recommend just to add a new Lobbytype named \"showcase\" where users can go who like animations and big particle shit. With a warning before joining lobbies of that kind. Many of the people in the animation scene and with that said many of the people promoting the game on youtube and other social media hated this change. \n\nJust think about it. A Lobbytype like this would solve many problems. Normal lobbies could be restricted. Animation  / Showcase lobbies could be without restrictions but with a warning before joining.",
